<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Pendaftaran PPDB {{nama_yayasan}} Berhasil Diterima</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin:0;background:#f5f5f7;color:#1d1d1f;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="background:#f5f5f7;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="max-width:640px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;overflow:hidden;">
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:16px 16px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;">
                <h1 style="margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:#1d1d1f;letter-spacing:-0.5px;">
                  Pendaftaran Berhasil
                </h1>
                <p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#4b5563;">
                  Halo <strong>{{nama_siswa}}</strong>, terima kasih telah menyelesaikan seluruh rangkaian pengisian formulir pengajuan pendaftaran peserta didik baru di bawah naungan {{nama_yayasan}}.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:16px 16px;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 18px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1d1d1f;">
                  Saat ini, tim Panitia kami sedang melakukan <strong>proses verifikasi dan validasi</strong> keaslian berkas secara bertahap.
                </p>
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;">Nomor Pendaftaran</td>
                    <td style="padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;color:#a7221b;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-align:right;">{{nomor_pendaftaran}}</td>
                  </tr>
                    <td style="padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;">NISN</td>
                    <td style="padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;color:#1d1d1f;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-align:right;">{{nisn}}</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;">Nama Lengkap</td>
                    <td style="padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;color:#1d1d1f;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-align:right;">{{nama_lengkap}}</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;">Asal Sekolah</td>
                    <td style="padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;color:#1d1d1f;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-align:right;">{{asal_sekolah}}</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:14px 18px;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;">Tanggal Registrasi</td>
                    <td style="padding:14px 18px;color:#1d1d1f;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-align:right;">{{tanggal_daftar}}</td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
                <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin: 28px 0 16px;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="background:#a7221b;border-radius:999px;">
                      <a href="{{url_cek_status}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 26px;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing: 0.2px;">
                        Cek Status Pendaftaran
                      </a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#86868b;">
                  Jika tombol di atas mengalami kendala akses, silakan gunakan tautan alternatif berikut pada peramban Anda: <br>
                  <span style="color: #2563eb; word-break: break-all;">{{url_cek_status}}</span>
                </p>

                <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin: 28px 0 20px;">

                <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#6b7280;">
                  Harap dicatat bahwa email ini merupakan bukti rekam data dan <em>bukan hasil akhir seleksi kelulusan, Silakan simpan nomor pendaftaran Anda dengan baik.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:18px 32px;background:#fef3f2;color:#81201b;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;text-align: center;font-weight: 400;">
                &copy; {{tahun}} - Panitia PPDB {{nama_yayasan}}
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
